rgin between about two and four points.\n\nExpert raters have shifted the race toward Democrats, with several calling it Lean D and others a Tossup, and prediction markets price Peltola around 75%. Sullivan retains the advantages of incumbency, a larger war chest, and a state that usually favors Republicans, while Peltola has outraised him and drawn heavy outside opposition. The race remains competitive but tilts modestly toward Democrats heading into the final weeks.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5747, "margin": 0.87}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6955, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6995, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6965, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6035, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5728, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6289, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6246, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.603, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6381, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6392, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6469, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6459, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6429, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6784, "margin": 2.5}]}